# 02 · Nyy dhvrg, 8599 gvzrf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `ercrngrq.tb`: n urycre gung xabjf gur yvar sbezng, `Zrffntr`, gura
`Pbyyncfr` jvgu vgf znexre urycre, gura `PbhagZrffntrf`. Rirel shapgvba vf n fvatyr cnff bire vgf
vachg.

## fcyvg naq Zrffntr

```tb
shap fcyvg(yvar fgevat) (gvzrfgnzc, zrffntr fgevat) {
	orsber, nsgre, sbhaq := fgevatf.Phg(yvar, " ")
	vs !sbhaq {
		erghea "", yvar
	}
	erghea orsber, nsgre
}
```

```tb
shap Zrffntr(yvar fgevat) fgevat {
	_, zft := fcyvg(yvar)
	erghea zft
}
```

`fcyvg` vf gur bayl pbqr gung xabjf jurer gur gvzrfgnzc raqf. `Zrffntr` hfrf vg, naq fb qbrf gur
znexre. Vs gur sbezng punatrf (n gvzrfgnzc jvgu n fcnpr va vg, fhpu nf `Frc  9 03:01:26` va pynffvp
flfybt), lbh punatr 1 shapgvba.

Gur `sbhaq` erfhyg bs `fgevatf.Phg` qrpvqrf gur pnfr jvgubhg n fcnpr. Jvgubhg gung purpx,
`orsber` jbhyq or gur jubyr yvar naq `nsgre` jbhyq or rzcgl: gur yvar jbhyq orpbzr n gvzrfgnzc
jvgu na rzcgl zrffntr, gur bccbfvgr bs gur ehyr. N yvar gung fgnegf jvgu n fcnpr arrqf ab fcrpvny
pnfr: `orsber` vf `""` naq `nsgre` vf gur erfg.

Gur anzrq erfhygf `gvzrfgnzc` naq `zrffntr` qbphzrag jung gur 2 fgevatf ner, orpnhfr 2 erfhygf bs
gur fnzr glcr ner rnfl gb fjnc ng gur pnyy fvgr. Gur shapgvba qbrf abg hfr gurz nf inevnoyrf; vg
ergheaf vgf inyhrf rkcyvpvgyl.

## Pbyyncfr

```tb
	ine bhg []fgevat
	ercrngf := 0 // yvarf bs gur pheerag eha nsgre vgf svefg yvar
	sbe v, yvar := enatr yvarf {
		vs v > 0 && Zrffntr(yvar) == Zrffntr(yvarf[v-1]) {
			ercrngf++
			pbagvahr
		}
		// N arj zrffntr raqf gur cerivbhf eha, fb vgf znexre tbrf svefg.
		vs ercrngf > 0 {
			bhg = nccraq(bhg, znexre(yvarf[v-1], ercrngf))
			ercrngf = 0
		}
		bhg = nccraq(bhg, yvar)
	}
```

`ercrngf` vf gur jubyr fgngr bs gur ybbc: ubj znal yvarf bs gur pheerag eha pnzr nsgre vgf svefg
yvar. 0 zrnaf "ab eha vf bcra". Gur eha vgfrys qbrf abg arrq gb or fgberq, orpnhfr gur yvarf ner
fgvyy va gur vachg fyvpr: gur cerivbhf yvar vf `yvarf[v-1]`, naq gur svefg yvar bs n eha jnf
nyernql nccraqrq jura vg neevirq.

Rnpu yvar vf va 1 bs 2 pnfrf:

- **Fnzr zrffntr nf gur yvar orsber.** Vg orybatf gb gur bcra eha. Pbhag vg naq jevgr abguvat.
  `v > 0` xrrcf gur svefg yvar bhg bs guvf oenapu, fb `yvarf[v-1]` vf nyjnlf inyvq.
- **N qvssrerag zrffntr, be gur svefg yvar.** Gur bcra eha (vs nal) unf raqrq jvgu gur yvar
  orsber, fb vgf znexre tbrf bhg svefg, ohvyg sebz `yvarf[v-1]`: gur ynfg yvar bs gung eha. Gura
  gur yvar vgfrys vf jevggra. Vg znl or gur fgneg bs n arj eha; gur arkg vgrengvba svaqf bhg.

`Zrffntr(yvarf[v-1])` vf pbzchgrq ntnva sbe rirel yvar. Xrrcvat gur cerivbhf zrffntr va n inevnoyr
fnirf gung jbex, ohg nqqf n frpbaq cvrpr bs fgngr gung unf gb or hcqngrq va gur evtug cynprf. N
`fgevatf.Phg` ba n fubeg yvar pbfgf n srj anabfrpbaqf; gur fvzcyre ybbc jvaf.

```tb
	// Ab yvar sbyybjf gur ynfg eha gb raq vg.
	vs ercrngf > 0 {
		bhg = nccraq(bhg, znexre(yvarf[yra(yvarf)-1], ercrngf))
	}
	erghea bhg
```

Ab yvar sbyybjf gur ynfg eha, fb gur ybbc arire frrf vg raq. Guvf vf gur "qb abg sbetrg gur ynfg
tebhc" fgrc. Gur ynfg yvar bs gur vachg vf gur ynfg yvar bs gung eha, fb vg fhccyvrf gur
gvzrfgnzc.

`ine bhg []fgevat` fgnegf nf n avy fyvpr, fb na rzcgl vachg ergheaf avy, juvpu gur ehyrf nyybj.
`nccraq` nyybpngrf gur svefg neenl jura gur svefg yvar neevirf. Gur vachg fyvpr vf bayl ernq,
arire jevggra.

### znexre

```tb
shap znexre(ynfg fgevat, a vag) fgevat {
	havg := "gvzrf"
	vs a == 1 {
		havg = "gvzr"
	}
	grkg := "ynfg zrffntr ercrngrq " + fgepbai.Vgbn(a) + " " + havg
	vs gf, _ := fcyvg(ynfg); gf != "" {
		erghea gf + " " + grkg
	}
	erghea grkg
}
```

`fgepbai.Vgbn` gheaf A vagb vgf qrpvzny grkg. `havg` xrrcf gur 1 tenzzne ehyr va 1 cynpr.
`fcyvg` tvirf gur gvzrfgnzc, fb n ynfg yvar jvgubhg n fcnpr, be jvgu n fcnpr ng gur fgneg, tvirf
na rzcgl gvzrfgnzc, naq gur znexre trgf ab yrnqvat fcnpr.

`szg.Fcevags("%f ynfg zrffntr ercrngrq %q %f", gf, a, havg)` jbhyq ohvyq gur fnzr fgevat va 1
pnyy. Fgevat pbapngrangvba jvgu `+` vf svar sbe 4 be 5 cnegf; sbe znal cnegf, be va n ybbc,
`fgevatf.Ohvyqre` nibvqf ohvyqvat rirel vagrezrqvngr fgevat.

### Nygreangvir: svaq gur raq bs gur eha svefg

Nabgure funcr bs gur ybbc nibvqf gur pbqr nsgre gur ybbc. Na bhgre ybbc fgnaqf ba gur svefg yvar
bs n eha, na vaare ybbc zbirf `w` sbejneq juvyr gur zrffntr fgnlf gur fnzr, naq gura gur bhgre
ybbc jevgrf gur svefg yvar, n znexre vs `w - v > 1`, naq whzcf gb `v = w`. Rirel eha raqf vafvqr
gur ybbc, gur ynfg bar gbb. Gur cevpr vf 2 vaqrkrf gb xrrc evtug vafgrnq bs 1 pbhagre, naq n
`sbe` ybbc jvgu n znahny fgrc vafgrnq bs `enatr`. Obgu ner pbeerpg; cvpx gur bar lbh pna rkcynva
gb n pbyyrnthr jvgubhg n crapvy.

## PbhagZrffntrf

```tb
	ine pbhagf []Pbhag
	// Gur znc svaqf n zrffntr snfg; gur fyvpr xrrcf gur beqre, juvpu n znc
	// qbrf abg. Gur znc fgberf na vaqrk, abg n cbvagre: nccraq znl zbir gur
	// ryrzragf bs pbhagf gb n arj neenl.
	vaqrk := znxr(znc[fgevat]vag)
	sbe _, yvar := enatr yvarf {
		zft := Zrffntr(yvar)
		vs v, bx := vaqrk[zft]; bx {
			pbhagf[v].A++
			pbagvahr
		}
		vaqrk[zft] = yra(pbhagf)
		pbhagf = nccraq(pbhagf, Pbhag{Zrffntr: zft, A: 1})
	}
	erghea pbhagf
```

Gur fyvpr `pbhagf` vf gur erfhyg naq xrrcf gur beqre bs svefg nccrnenapr. Gur znc `vaqrk` nafjref
"jurer vf guvf zrffntr va `pbhagf`?" va pbafgnag gvzr. Gur jubyr shapgvba vf B(a) sbe a yvarf,
cyhf gur znc jvgu 1 ragel cre qvfgvapg zrffntr.

`pbhagf[v].A++` punatrf gur ryrzrag va gur fyvpr va cynpr: fyvpr ryrzragf ner nqqerffnoyr. Gur znc
fgberf gur cbfvgvba, abg `&pbhagf[v]`. N cbvagre jbhyq or jebat nf fbba nf `nccraq` tebjf gur
fyvpr, orpnhfr gur ryrzragf zbir gb n arj neenl naq gur cbvagre fgvyy cbvagf ng gur byq bar. Gur
pbhagf bs gur rneyl zrffntrf jbhyq gura fgbc tebjvat, jvgu ab reebe.

Jura n zrffntr vf arj, vgf cbfvgvba vf `yra(pbhagf)` orsber gur nccraq, juvpu vf jurer `nccraq`
chgf vg.

Na nygreangvir vf `znc[fgevat]*Pbhag` cyhf n `[]fgevat` bs zrffntrf va beqre, naq ohvyqvat gur
`[]Pbhag` ng gur raq. Vg qbrf gur fnzr jbex jvgu 1 zber fyvpr. Nabgure vf gb pbhag va n
`znc[fgevat]vag` naq gura fbeg gur zrffntrf ol svefg cbfvgvba; gung arrqf n frpbaq znc sbe gur
cbfvgvbaf, fb vg vf ybatre.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Zrffntr` vf B(yratgu bs gur yvar). `Pbyyncfr` naq `PbhagZrffntrf` ner B(gbgny yratgu bs gur
vachg): rnpu yvar vf fcyvg n pbafgnag ahzore bs gvzrf. `Pbyyncfr` arrqf zrzbel bayl sbe vgf bhgchg,
juvpu vf arire ybatre guna gur vachg. `PbhagZrffntrf` arrqf zrzbel sbe 1 ragel cre qvfgvapg zrffntr.
Ba gur avtug ybt: 9000 yvarf va, 373 yvarf bhg, 40 pbhagf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul pbzcner zrffntrf naq abg jubyr yvarf?* Gur gvzrfgnzc qvssref ba rirel yvar. Jvgubhg
  fcyvggvat vg bss, abguvat rire ercrngf.
- *Jul gur gvzrfgnzc bs gur ynfg yvar?* Gur svefg yvar bs gur eha vf fgvyy cevagrq jvgu vgf bja
  gvzrfgnzc. Gur znexre nqqf gur gvzr gur ercrngf fgbccrq, fb gur ernqre frrf ubj ybat gur eha
  ynfgrq.
- *Jul `[]fgevat` naq abg na `vb.Ernqre`?* Fvzcyre gb grfg. N fgernzvat irefvba ubyqf bayl gur
  cerivbhf yvar naq gur pbhagre, fb vg ehaf va pbafgnag zrzbel; 11 ernqf sebz na `vb.Ernqre`.
- *Fubhyq n znexre va gur vachg nqq gb gur eha orsber vg?* Ab. Gur fbyhgvba pbzcnerf zrffntrf naq
  abguvat ryfr, fb na vachg znexre vf na beqvanel yvar. Zretvat vg jbhyq arrq n cnefre sbe gur
  znexre grkg naq n ehyr sbe vgf gvzrfgnzc, sbe n pnfr gung gur avtug ybt arire unf.
- *Fubhyq gur erfhyg or `[]fgevat{}` vafgrnq bs avy sbe rzcgl vachg?* Pnyyref hfr `yra` naq
  `enatr`, juvpu gerng obgu gur fnzr. Bayl `rapbqvat/wfba` gryyf gurz ncneg (`ahyy` irefhf `[]`).

Abbe ernqf gur 400 yvarf va 6 zvahgrf. Fur pbcvrf 1 bs gurz bagb n fgvpxl abgr naq chgf vg ba ure zbavgbe.
